        "notes": "We are going to keep the focus on weapon power and surviveability and are adding  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054). Again we are still just trying to build econ and stay alive, we aren't full building into AP yet. Pick up attack speed or armor as necessary.\n\nSplurge on [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you have the money. If your walls are getting a ton of value, consider  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) or [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) instead of  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).\n\nFinally, if survivability is tough, consider additional armor [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) to improve your uptime.",
